{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-06-08 10:05:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR INC. INCREASES DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL. , JUNE 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) VOTED TODAY TO RAISE THE QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND BY NINE CENTS, AN 8% INCREASE, TO ONE DOLLAR AND TWENTY CENTS ($1.20) PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE AUGUST 19, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JULY 20, 2022.'}